Trimmed real data from Homebrew, fetched 2026-09-26 (ruling T1):

- casks.jsonl: 11 of the 2,599 font casks of https://formulae.brew.sh/api/cask.json
  (the 8 casks with old_tokens and 3 without), each cut to its token and old_tokens.
  Built by formulae.brew.sh from the Homebrew/homebrew-cask repository at commit
  81097d41aaaa8d6927a697667b01112ab1817a96.
- renames.json: the 10 entries of 228 in
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/homebrew-cask/main/cask_renames.json
  whose old or new token starts with "font-".

The tests write both into a snapshot of a temporary store, as the homebrew_casks
collector's fetch() does (casks.jsonl becomes casks.jsonl.gz).

